# The repo root .gitignore excludes package.json / package-lock.json, which
# suited the earlier dependency-free sites. This one has a real build step and
# needs `sharp` installed, so both files must be tracked or the Vercel build
# fails at `npm install`.
!package.json
!package-lock.json
